        "html": "\u003cdiv class=\"mockup-component--main-footer\">\n\u003cfooter>\u003cdiv class=\"row\">\u003cstrong class=\"logo\">VISD\u003c/strong>\u003cdiv>\u003cbutton type=\"button\" disabled>개인정보처리방침\u003c/button>\u003c/div>\u003c/div>\u003cp>이메일 sales@visd.kr | 대표 정윤호 | 사업자등록번호 236-50-00813\u003c/p>\u003cp>대구광역시 동성로 5길 17 1F\u003c/p>\u003c/footer>\n\u003c/div>",
