        "html": "\u003cdiv class=\"mockup-component--v2-overview-media\">\n\u003csection>\u003cdiv class=\"split intro-media\">\u003cdiv>\u003cdiv class=\"placeholder\" style=\"height:280px\" data-reference-asset=\"https://www.global-visd.com/img/solution/hero-bg.webp\">\u003csvg viewBox=\"0 0 100 100\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\u003cpath d=\"M0 0L100 100M100 0L0 100\"/>\u003c/svg>\u003cspan>기존 솔루션 소개 이미지\u003csmall>기존 이미지 활용\u003c/small>\u003c/span>\u003c/div>\u003c/div>\u003cdiv>\u003cdiv class=\"placeholder\" style=\"height:280px\">\u003csvg viewBox=\"0 0 100 100\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\u003cpath d=\"M0 0L100 100M100 0L0 100\"/>\u003c/svg>\u003cspan>인트로 영상 배치 영역\u003csmall>기존 인트로 영상 활용 제안 / 원본 확인 필요\u003c/small>\u003c/span>\u003c/div>\u003c/div>\u003c/div>\u003c/section>\n\u003c/div>",
